 r←Version(space folder args)
⍝ Returns the version number together with the namespace the user commands actually execute
⍝ their code in. Which one that is depends on `DEVELOPMENT` in `⎕SE.APLGit2`; see
⍝ `GetRefToAPLGit2`. Since that is sticky session state, it is worth reporting.
⍝ Desc: Returns the version number as a text vector
⍝ Parse: 
⍝ Project: 0
 r←##.Version,' (executing in ',(⍕##),')'
⍝Done
